    "result_text": "Full suite is green. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `POST /api/owners` \u2192 `GET /api/owners/{id}` flow now returns a `selfLink` field. Two edits:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `selfLink` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field.\n\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct mapping computing it from the entity:\n   ```java\n   @Mapping(target = \"selfLink\",\n       expression = \"java(owner.getId() == null ? null : \\\"/api/owners/\\\" + owner.getId())\")\n   ```\n\nThe `AcceptanceTest.coreReturnsSelfLink` test and the full suite pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`), with `$.selfLink` equal to `/api/owners/{id}`.",
